    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A logic gate takes binary inputs (0 or 1) and produces a binary output.<br>You are given a gate name and several pairs of input values.<br>For each pair, evaluate the gate and print the resulting bit.<br>All answers must be printed on a single line, space-separated.<br><br>Supported gates:<br>BUFFER: output = input A (0 becomes 0, 1 becomes 1)<br>NOT: output = 1 - A<br>AND: output = 1 only if A = 1 and B = 1, otherwise 0<br>OR: output = 1 if at least one of A, B is 1, otherwise 0<br>NAND: opposite of AND<br>NOR: opposite of OR<br>XOR: output = 1 if A and B differ, otherwise 0<br>XNOR: opposite of XOR<br><br>For BUFFER and NOT, the second value on a line is ignored.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The gate name <var>G</var>.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> The number of input pairs <var>K</var>.<br><strong>Next K lines:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>A</var> and <var>B</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> <var>K</var> space-separated bits, the results for the pairs in order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><var>G</var> is one of BUFFER, NOT, AND, OR, NAND, NOR, XOR, XNOR<br>1 &lt;= <var>K</var> &lt;= 8<br><var>A</var>, <var>B</var> are 0 or 1</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">BUFFER\n4\n0 0\n1 0\n1 1\n1 1</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">0 1 1 1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
